@page "/"

<PageTitle>AI Coding Research Portal</PageTitle>

<section class="role-hero">
    <span class="eyebrow">Research support application</span>
    <h1>Choose your workspace</h1>
    <p>Participants submit AI interaction evidence and source code. Researchers manage the study, review logs and assess coding outcomes.</p>
</section>

<div class="role-grid">
    <a class="role-card participant-role" href="/participant">
        <span class="role-icon">P</span>
        <span class="role-kicker">Student / Participant</span>
        <h2>Submit research evidence</h2>
        <p>Select your anonymous participant ID and assigned task, then record or import AI logs and upload your source code.</p>
        <span class="role-features"><i>✓</i> Manual interaction entry</span>
        <span class="role-features"><i>✓</i> JSON, CSV and TXT import</span>
        <span class="role-features"><i>✓</i> Source code submission</span>
        <strong>Open participant portal →</strong>
    </a>

    <a class="role-card researcher-role" href="/researcher">
        <span class="role-icon">R</span>
        <span class="role-kicker">Researcher / Admin</span>
        <h2>Manage the research dataset</h2>
        <p>Manage participants and assignments, review AI usage classifications and score submitted code with the research rubric.</p>
        <span class="role-features"><i>✓</i> Participant and task management</span>
        <span class="role-features"><i>✓</i> AI log quality review</span>
        <span class="role-features"><i>✓</i> Coding assessment</span>
        <strong>Open researcher console →</strong>
    </a>
</div>

<p class="privacy-note">Use only the anonymous participant ID supplied by the research team. Do not enter student names or personal information.</p>
